      },
      "message": "feat(post): Grbl 1.1 post for 3-axis mills\n\nAdd grbl.cps and the Grbl 3-axis machine. Grbl 1.1 has no canned\ncycles, no cutter compensation and no tool table, so drill cycles post\nas G0/G1/G4 moves, bore and tap are refused by name, a tool change is\nM0 with comments, and a line is at most 79 characters.\n\nFixes #2481\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
